t kangaroos that are trying to steal your beer! Cook and bring drinks to your mates, but don't forget to defend your BBQ from those pesky kangaroos!  \n\n-- 1 Year Update --\nThanks for an epic year of boomerangs, beers, and roo chaos! Dive into the fun. Here's to another year of awesome boomerang battles!\n\nWe reduced the price by 75% and added new game modes! Go and explore \n", "short_description": "A Chaotic Survival/Cooking game where kangaroos are stealing your beer!\nMulti-task between cooking for your mates and assaulting Australian fauna.\nMaster your fully physics-based boomerangs and defend your BBQ\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Witty Platypus", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spelkollektivet", "support_website_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/", "website_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "FOOD", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "ko", "pt", "en", "it", "fr", "es", "ja", "pl", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24207516532208730"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441580_5531256650325896_5922474532383571934_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AJlaZPxJo-cQ7kN